--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Runtime-downloaded assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`semantic init` downloads two third-party artifacts into the OS cache directory.
Neither is vendored into this repository, and neither ships in the binary.

  all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (ONNX export)
    Apache License 2.0
    Model by the Sentence-Transformers authors (UKP Lab, TU Darmstadt).
    ONNX export by Xenova, distributed via Hugging Face.
    https://huggingface.co/Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2

  ONNX Runtime
    MIT License
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation
    https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

